    {
      "name": "Vanguard",
      "type": "class",
      "img": "icons/equipment/shield/heater-crystal-blue.webp",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p><strong>Move, bitch. Get out the way.</strong></p><p><em>—Ludacris, Move Bitch</em></p><p>Vanguards are terrifying sentinels of heavy metal armor that use shields to devastate their foes, standing tall as mobile bastions of fortitude and might.</p><h3>Iconic Vanguards</h3><ul><li><strong>Groot</strong>, <em>Guardians of the Galaxy</em></li><li><strong>Havel</strong>, <em>Dark Souls</em></li><li><strong>Juggernaut</strong>, <em>X-Men</em></li><li><strong>Reinhardt</strong>, <em>Overwatch</em></li></ul><h3>Playing Vanguard</h3><p>The vanguard is a high-defense tank, trading off raw damage output for control. Actively defend through the Rush Action and Shoves.</p><p><strong>Action:</strong> Shove (Attack)<br /><strong>Move:</strong> Frontline<br /><strong>Starting Pack:</strong> Sentinel<br /><strong>Key Stat:</strong> Might<br /><strong>Complexity:</strong> ★★★☆☆<br /><strong>Training:</strong> Brawl, Melee</p><h3>Class Features</h3><table class=\"NormalTable\"><tbody><tr><td><p><strong>Level</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Features</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>1st</p></td><td><p>Crowd Control, Stalwart</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>2nd</p></td><td><p>Wall (1 size)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>3rd</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>4th</p></td><td><p>Indestructible (+1)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>5th</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>6th</p></td><td><p>Wall (2 sizes), Armored Titan</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>7th</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>8th</p></td><td><p>Indestructible (+2)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>9th</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>10th</p></td><td><p>Wall (3 sizes), Force Unrelenting</p></td></tr></tbody></table>",
        "isSpellcaster": false,
        "levelFeatures": [
          {
            "level": 1,
            "name": "Crowd Control",
            "description": "<p>You can try to Shove a Close Target (no Action) when they Move Close to you, or when you roll a Defense Weapon’s damage die.</p><p>Further, you can push Targets you Shove ahead of you while you Move during the same Turn. If you push it into an occupied space, it deals your Weapon’s damage to the Target and whatever occupied the space.</p>",
            "statBonusPoints": 0,
            "extraTraining": 0,
            "requiredSpells": [],
            "allowedPerks": [],
            "perkAmount": 0,
            "spellAmount": 0,
            "skillChoices": []
          },
          {
            "level": 1,
            "name": "Stalwart",
            "description": "<p>You gain the Protector Perk (p. 71) and, when you take the Hold Action, you can use the held Action or Move as late as the end of your next Turn.</p>",
            "statBonusPoints": 0,
            "extraTraining": 0,
            "requiredSpells": [],
            "allowedPerks": [
              "Compendium.vagabond.perks.Item.aHBvA8INtAilA7zH"
            ],
            "perkAmount": 1,
            "spellAmount": 0,
            "skillChoices": []
          },
          {
            "level": 2,
            "name": "Wall (1 size)",
            "description": "<p>You are considered one size larger for Shoves and the damage dice of Defense Weapons are one size larger while you have them Equipped.</p><p>Both of these sizes increase by another size every 4 Levels hereafter.</p>",
            "statBonusPoints": 1,
            "extraTraining": 0,
            "requiredSpells": [],
            "allowedPerks": [],
            "perkAmount": 0,
